    "detailed_description": "THE CURSE RETURNS ONCE AGAIN.<br><br>Mayuhara City, Tokyo. <br>The wounds of the mass suicide event of Mayuhara Academy from eight years ago have finally begun to heal. <br>The rumors of the \u201cMayuhara Curse\u201d are still whispered amongst the students. <br><br>\u2500\u2500The curse drove them to suicide\u2500\u2500<br><br>A series of mysterious deaths have once again begun to haunt Mayuhara Academy.<br>Were these strange incidents really the fault of the curse?<br>Or perhaps\u2026?<br><br>After the loss of their classmate, three young girls begin investigating the mysterious events.<br>As they peer into the shadow of the curse, they quickly find their everyday lives consumed by its madness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the gameplay</h2>Noroware Cycle switches between side scroller exploration, investigation and visual novel-like scenes.<br>See what the people of Mayuhara city know of the rumors. Gather information with your smartphone, <br>search for clues and analyze your evidence to advance the story and discover the truth behind the curse of Mayuhara Academy.",
